  "paper_id": "eurosys-2026-2dio-configurable-and-cache-accurate-trace-generation-fo-25101ea1",
  "title": "2DIO: Configurable and Cache-Accurate Trace Generation for Storage Benchmarking",
  "abstract": "We present 2DIO, a trace generator creating cache-accurate, stressful I/O workloads. While existing tools are limited to generating traces with well-behaved, concave hit ratio curves, 2DIO produces ones with tunable complex cache behaviors, particularly performance cliffs and plateaus.",
